    <p class="ind-sub">Restaurants are among the most water-intensive commercial uses per square foot &mdash; kitchen equipment, dishwashing, ice machines, and grease trap compliance all driving significant water cost. WST audits, recovers overcharges, and monitors consumption for restaurant groups and QSR operators.</p>
